Can't follow a French conversation? Use these 5 lifesavers 🛟🇫🇷

• je ne comprends pas = I don't understand
• plus lentement = more slowly
• vous parlez anglais ? = do you speak English?
• comment ça se dit… ? = how do you say…?
• j'adore = I love it

💙 Comment "j'adore" if you love learning French 👇
💌 Save this for when you get stuck
👯 Send it to your French-learning buddy

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

